('bmlt-electrolyteabg1-mcq-006','BMLT','BMLT NHPC Licensing','mcq','free',6,'{"question":"A hemolyzed specimen may falsely increase:","translation":"","options":["Potassium","Sodium in every case","Chloride always","Bicarbonate always"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Red cell rupture releases intracellular potassium into the sample.","explanationNe":"Red cell फुट्दा intracellular potassium sample मा निस्कन्छ।","topic":"Electrolytes, Blood Gas & Acid–Base Balance"}'::jsonb,true),
